  "data": [
    {
      "id": "2064394146916229443",
      "text": "Introducing Claude Fable 5: a Mythos-class model that we’ve made safe for general use.\n\nIts capabilities exceed those of any model we’ve ever made generally available. https://t.co/2AvmEjHIX8",
      "author": {
        "id": "1943306828697550848",
        "name": "Claude",
        "screenName": "claudeai",
        "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1950950107937185792/QOfEjFoJ_normal.jpg",
        "verified": true
      },
      "metrics": {
        "likes": 103126,
        "retweets": 14373,
        "replies": 4832,
        "quotes": 9699,
        "views": 52393792,
        "bookmarks": 21584
      },
      "createdAt": "Tue Jun 09 17:08:13 +0000 2026",
      "createdAtLocal": "2026-06-10 01:08",
      "createdAtISO": "2026-06-09T17:08:13+00:00",
      "media": [
        {
          "type": "video",
          "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2064389698190012416/vid/avc1/2160x2160/cRYBJVhIVvopbO92.mp4?tag=27",
          "width": 1048,
          "height": 1488
        }
      ],
      "urls": [],
      "isRetweet": false,
      "retweetedBy": null,
      "lang": "en",
      "score": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2064394151441863006",
      "text": "Fable 5 is state-of-the-art on nearly all tested benchmarks, with exceptional performance in software engineering, knowledge work, scientific research, and vision.\n\nThe longer and more complex the task, the larger Fable 5’s lead over our other models. https://t.co/DxgSu0KUxh",
      "author": {
        "id": "1943306828697550848",
        "name": "Claude",
        "screenName": "claudeai",
        "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1950950107937185792/QOfEjFoJ_normal.jpg",
        "verified": true
      },
      "metrics": {
        "likes": 15414,
        "retweets": 1777,
        "replies": 498,
        "quotes": 1224,
        "views": 5231668,
        "bookmarks": 2355
      },
      "createdAt": "Tue Jun 09 17:08:14 +0000 2026",
      "createdAtLocal": "2026-06-10 01:08",
      "createdAtISO": "2026-06-09T17:08:14+00:00",
      "media": [
        {
          "type": "photo",
          "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HKYwNlEWMAAJanX.png",
          "width": 2160,
          "height": 2160
        }
      ],
      "urls": [],
      "isRetweet": false,
      "retweetedBy": null,
      "lang": "en",
      "score": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2064394155258765783",
      "text": "Releasing a model this capable comes with risks. Without safeguards, Fable 5’s capabilities in areas like cybersecurity could be misused to cause serious damage.\n\nQueries on a narrow range of topics will instead receive a response from our next-most-capable model, Opus 4.8. https://t.co/vJ71vCdkjc",
      "author": {
        "id": "1943306828697550848",
        "name": "Claude",
        "screenName": "claudeai",
        "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1950950107937185792/QOfEjFoJ_normal.jpg",
        "verified": true
      },
      "metrics": {
        "likes": 7597,
        "retweets": 412,
        "replies": 166,
        "quotes": 179,
        "views": 1200807,
        "bookmarks": 1082
      },
      "createdAt": "Tue Jun 09 17:08:15 +0000 2026",
      "createdAtLocal": "2026-06-10 01:08",
      "createdAtISO": "2026-06-09T17:08:15+00:00",
      "media": [
        {
          "type": "video",
          "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2064390880996265984/vid/avc1/3840x2160/d3LHIYZ9GsRkcO7y.mp4?tag=27",
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      ],
      "urls": [],
      "isRetweet": false,
      "retweetedBy": null,
      "lang": "en",
      "score": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2064394156735172627",
      "text": "Fable 5’s safeguards detect requests related to cybersecurity, biology and chemistry, and distillation. Users are informed whenever a fallback occurs—on average in less than 5% of sessions.\n\nWe’ll keep refining the safeguards to reduce false positives.",
      "author": {
        "id": "1943306828697550848",
        "name": "Claude",
        "screenName": "claudeai",
        "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1950950107937185792/QOfEjFoJ_normal.jpg",
        "verified": true
      },
      "metrics": {
        "likes": 3234,
        "retweets": 98,
        "replies": 87,
        "quotes": 110,
        "views": 916986,
        "bookmarks": 204
      },
      "createdAt": "Tue Jun 09 17:08:16 +0000 2026",
      "createdAtLocal": "2026-06-10 01:08",
      "createdAtISO": "2026-06-09T17:08:16+00:00",
      "media": [],
      "urls": [],
      "isRetweet": false,
      "retweetedBy": null,
      "lang": "en",
      "score": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2064394158056386684",
      "text": "For a small group of cyber defenders and critical infrastructure providers, we are also launching Claude Mythos 5.\n\nMythos 5 shares the same underlying model as Fable 5, but with the safeguards lifted in some areas.",
      "author": {
        "id": "1943306828697550848",
        "name": "Claude",
        "screenName": "claudeai",
        "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1950950107937185792/QOfEjFoJ_normal.jpg",
        "verified": true
      },
      "metrics": {
        "likes": 2871,
        "retweets": 106,
        "replies": 29,
        "quotes": 38,
        "views": 657055,
        "bookmarks": 153
      },
      "createdAt": "Tue Jun 09 17:08:16 +0000 2026",
      "createdAtLocal": "2026-06-10 01:08",
      "createdAtISO": "2026-06-09T17:08:16+00:00",
      "media": [],
      "urls": [],
      "isRetweet": false,
      "retweetedBy": null,
      "lang": "en",
      "score": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2064394159318782217",
      "text": "Soon, we intend to expand access to Mythos 5 through a broader trusted access program, both for defensive cybersecurity work and biomedical research.",
      "author": {
        "id": "1943306828697550848",
        "name": "Claude",
        "screenName": "claudeai",
        "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1950950107937185792/QOfEjFoJ_normal.jpg",
        "verified": true
      },
      "metrics": {
        "likes": 2800,
        "retweets": 104,
        "replies": 35,
        "quotes": 31,
        "views": 727698,
        "bookmarks": 101
      },
      "createdAt": "Tue Jun 09 17:08:16 +0000 2026",
      "createdAtLocal": "2026-06-10 01:08",
      "createdAtISO": "2026-06-09T17:08:16+00:00",
      "media": [],
      "urls": [],
      "isRetweet": false,
      "retweetedBy": null,
      "lang": "en",
      "score": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2064394160522559632",
      "text": "Claude Fable 5 is available everywhere today. Claude Mythos 5 is restricted to Glasswing partners until we expand our trusted access program.\n\nhttps://t.co/iQymY0jiGq",
      "author": {
        "id": "1943306828697550848",
        "name": "Claude",
        "screenName": "claudeai",
        "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1950950107937185792/QOfEjFoJ_normal.jpg",
        "verified": true
